e to be hanged:\n\"It would be a calamity if I am spared. If I die, wreathed in smiles, India's mothers would wish their children to emulate Bhagat Singh and thus, the number of formidable freedom fighters would increase so much that it would be impossible for the satanic powers to stop the march of the revolution.\".", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:36:56Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "KP 40 Sal 20 Farhan 5 Akshay 15 Tapish 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:37:01Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "The very reason why they got arrested willingly. Knowing they would be tried and hanged most likely", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:37:29Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Their lives were meant to sow seeds for hundreds and thousands more such lives", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:37:51Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "It is such a powerful thought to own and act upon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:37:54Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Last so had to be wrt this man", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:13Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "10. In his letter, X had initially argued that love was a weakness for a revolutionary and could lead to a \"shattering of the will.\" Bhagat Singh, the \"tough\" revolutionary, actually took the opposite stance. He wrote:\n\"Love is a sublime emotion... it never makes a man weak, but always makes him strong.\"\nHe argued that a man who cannot love a person cannot truly love humanity or his country.\nX, feeling the immense pressure of the movement and the inevitable end, had expressed thoughts that Y might be a way out. Bhagat Singh’s response was a masterpiece of tough love. He called Y a \"heinous crime\" and a \"complete defeat.\" He told X that \"to suffer for a cause is the highest form of service,\" and that dying at the hands of the enemy (the gallows) was far superior to taking one's own life. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:28Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Gandhi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:39Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Oh", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:41Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Suicide", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:41Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Apology for Y", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:49Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Chandrashekhar?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:38:52Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Azad", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:39:04Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Rajguru ya Sukhdev?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]